<title>GERMANY: German state of Hesse details July cost of living.</title>
<headline>German state of Hesse details July cost of living.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics office in the west German state of Hesse on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of its July cost of living data.</p>
<p>    Index/component			   mth/mth   yr/yr  Index</p>
<p>    Overall price index		     +0.5	+1.6   116.1</p>
<p>    Prices exc heating oil, fuel	  +0.5	+1.7   116.2</p>
<p>    Prices exc seasonal goods	     +0.6	+1.7   116.6</p>
<p>    Rents					 +0.0	+2.2   128.4</p>
<p>    Household energy			  -0.1	+2.2   99.7</p>
<p>    Personal goods, services and other  +4.8	+2.7   131.0</p>
<p>    Transport and communications	  +0.3	+0.6   115.3</p>
<p>    Furniture and other household goods +0.0	+0.5   111.5</p>
<p>    Foodstuffs, drinks, tobacco	   -0.3	+1.1   110.9</p>
<p>    Clothing, shoes			   +0.1	+0.8   109.1</p>
<p>    Health and personal care items	+3.4	+5.1   116.3</p>
<p>    Education, entertainment, leisure   +0.3	+0.6   115.3</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
